  "content": "\n\n<h2>關於</h2>\n<p>新增一種紙板飛機，專為長距離包裹物流設計，且支援跨維度運輸。當你不在基地時，可用於個人物品請求，或進行前哨站與好友間的包裹派送與取件。毋庸多言，你的基地需配備區塊載入器。</p>\n<h2>Create More 系列模組</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-linked-remote\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">遠端連結</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-parallel-pipes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">平行管線</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-pipe-bombs-in-packages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">管線炸彈包裹</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-package-couriers\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">包裹送遞員</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/create-more-vertical-additions\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">垂直傳送帶</a></li>\n</ul>\n<h2>即將推出™</h2>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/644da16b-5cfd-4f3d-9aa0-f0e5e6855a87\" alt=\"精靈送遞員\"></p>",
